calls the nested Russian dolls of life.

19:37.940 --> 19:42.600
And to map this multi-scale reality, the paper introduces sheath theory.

19:43.100 --> 19:44.020
Oh, sheath theory.

19:44.020 --> 19:44.300
Yeah.

