21:55.480 --> 21:56.040
Right.

21:56.280 --> 22:01.680
But they must also process payroll to maintain the overarching corporate structure.

22:02.840 --> 22:07.560
Admissible gluing dictates that the accounting department must be allowed to run its local

22:07.560 --> 22:08.960
