And through an evolutionary event, they became admissibly glued into the higher order loop

24:23.200 --> 24:24.560
of the eukaryotic cell.

24:25.440 --> 24:31.300
The mitochondria retained their internal local closure while being seamlessly integrated into

24:31.300 --> 24:32.480
a global section.

24:32.680 --> 24:37.060
But then you have parasitism, which is mathematically inadmissible gluing.

24:37.180 --> 24:37.560
Yes.

