A tapeworm establishes its own endomorphism loop inside the host, but it does so by aggressively

24:44.200 --> 24:48.680
siphoning energy and actively degrading the constraints of the host's loop.

24:48.940 --> 24:52.480
It violates the mutual preservation geometry entirely.

24:52.900 --> 24:53.260
Right.

24:53.580 --> 24:59.820
But I think the most profound application of this Schieff framework is its redefinition of

24:59.820 --> 25:00.220
cancer.

