27:47.000 --> 27:52.720
It fractures the admissibility relations across dozens of interconnected diffuse stalks,

27:52.720 --> 27:56.040
which causes cascading nonlinear degradation.

27:56.300 --> 27:56.940
Exactly.

27:56.940 --> 28:03.040
So, if life is this incredibly delicate, nested sheaf of mathematical loops,

28:03.920 --> 28:08.660
