how does the system autonomously navigate back to a state of robust closure?

28:20.740 --> 28:24.900
This introduces the most mathematically complex aspect afflictions paper,

28:25.360 --> 28:26.660
the CLIO operator.

28:26.660 --> 28:28.060
The CLIO operator.

