32:47.800 --> 32:48.620
Exactly.

32:48.620 --> 32:56.400
It proves that closure seeking, this algorithmic drive to discover mutually compatible, non-contradictory

32:56.400 --> 33:03.220
constraint structures, is a universal principle that spans both thermodynamic reality and cognitive

33:03.220 --> 33:04.080
representation.

